<gsdoc base="OresmeKit">
  <head>        
    <title>The Oresme Project</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <chapter>
      <heading>OresmeKit documentation</heading>
      <section>
        <heading>What are OresmeKit classes?</heading>
        <p>Oresme kit contains a collection of classes useful for displaying graphs</p>
        <p>Different classes, which subclass NSView and are thus embeddable as GUI components, provide different chart types.</p>
      </section>
    </chapter>
    <back>
      <chapter>
        <heading>API Documentation</heading>
        <p>The index below lists the major components of the OresmeKit
        documentation.</p>
        <index type="title" scope="project" target="mainFrame" />
      </chapter>
    </back>
  </body>
</gsdoc>
